QD\"}},\"ianaTimeZoneName\":\"Europe/London\"}],\"films\":[{\"id\":\"HO00006550\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Train Dreams\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Based on the beloved novella by Denis Johnson, Train Dreams is the moving portrait of Robert Grainier (Edgerton), whose life unfolds during an era of unprecedented change in early 20th-century America.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Based on the beloved novella by Denis Johnson, Train Dreams is the moving portrait of Robert Grainier (Edgerton), whose life unfolds during an era of unprecedented change\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000004\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"moderate violence, threat, sex\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-11-07\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":102,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":4,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000161\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001039\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001516\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004240\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000006665\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008151\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008438\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000009524\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000009528\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011787\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012514\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012515\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012516\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"85f2ffb9-a3e6-437c-b922-52ecdaa5292b\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006550\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008091\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Black Bear\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006677\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Hamnet\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"From Academy Award® winning writer/director Chloé Zhao, HAMNET tells the powerful love story that inspired the creation of Shakespeare’s timeless masterpiece, Hamlet.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"From Academy Award® winning writer/director Chloé Zhao, HAMNET tells the powerful love story that inspired the creation of Shakespeare’s timeless masterpiece, Hamlet.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000004\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"distressing scenes, brief moderate sex\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-09\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":126,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Y9Tv9wGPxIw\",\"displayPriority\":1,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000175\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001040\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001087\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002138\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002310\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004702\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004703\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005314\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007765\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012800\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"c566d7dc-50bb-4d55-984b-c4c65751933e\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006677\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008241\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Universal Pictures\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006679\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"28 Years Later: The Bone Temple\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Expanding upon the world created by Danny Boyle and Alex Garland in 28 Years Later - but turning that world on its head - Nia DaCosta directs 28 Years Later: The Bone Temple. In a continuation of the epic story, Dr. Kelson (Ralph Fiennes) finds himself in a shocking new relationship - with consequences that could change the world as they know it - and Spike's (Alfie Williams) encounter with Jimmy Crystal (Jack O'Connell) becomes a nightmare he can't escape. In the world of The Bone Temple, the infected are no longer the greatest threat to survival - the inhumanity of the survivors can be stranger and more terrifying. \\r\\n\\r\\nCUSTOMER NOTICE: This screening is restricted to viewers aged 18 and over. Valid identification must be presented at admission.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Expanding upon the world created by Danny Boyle and Alex Garland in 28 Years Later - but turning that world on its head - Nia DaCosta directs 28 Years Later.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000005\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-16\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":110,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rl_DJZCyEH4\",\"displayPriority\":3,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000313\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001245\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001270\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003206\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004531\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000010558\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011257\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011418\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011419\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012645\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012802\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000030\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"ce27f9c4-2b7c-4839-b9e6-0ceceb8e7949\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006679\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008243\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Sony Pictures\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006680\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Rental Family\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"A down-and-out actor living in Tokyo is hired as a token American guy for a Japanese rental-family company, leading him on an unexpected journey of self-discovery through the roles he plays in other people’s lives.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"A down-and-out actor living in Tokyo is hired as a token American guy for a Japanese rental-family company, leading him on an unexpected journey of self-discovery.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000004\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-09\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":103,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sZT37sM2VgE\",\"displayPriority\":4,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004929\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008380\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008381\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000010355\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012803\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012804\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012805\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012806\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012807\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\",\"0000000003\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"5675d1e4-8525-4a12-8283-5e88dcc4e188\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006680\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008244\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Walt Disney Studios Motion Pictures - UK\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006687\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"The History of Sound\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"In 1917, Lionel — a young, talented music student — meets David at the Boston Conservatory, where they bond over a deep love of folk music. Years later, Lionel receives a letter from David, leading to an impromptu journey through the backwoods of Maine to collect traditional songs. This unexpected reunion, ensuing love affair, and the music they collect and preserve, will shape the course of Lionel’s life far beyond his own awareness.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Two young men during World War I set out to record the lives, voices and music of their American countrymen.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"brief strong sex\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-23\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":128,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=E2PSkw8BI7k\",\"displayPriority\":3,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002283\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002310\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004336\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007164\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007677\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008293\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012816\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012817\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012818\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012819\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012820\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012821\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012822\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\",\"0000000033\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"c8ef0b42-7ed8-4ee1-9534-85771b63b7fc\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006687\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008252\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Universal Pictures\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006689\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"No Other Choice\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"After being unemployed for several years, a man devises a unique plan to secure a new job: eliminate his competition.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"After being unemployed for several years, a man devises a unique plan to secure a new job: eliminate his competition.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-23\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":139,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":1,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012169\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012827\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012828\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012829\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012830\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012831\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\",\"0000000026\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"9ecc0908-a983-42f7-9591-6f8d73d7488b\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006689\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008255\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"MUBI\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006609\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Marty Supreme\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Marty Mauser, a young man with a dream no one respects, goes to hell and back in pursuit of greatness.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Marty Mauser, a young man with a dream no one respects, goes to hell and back in pursuit of greatness.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-12-26\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":149,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PNDVyJU99M0\",\"displayPriority\":2,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001403\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001416\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002090\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003985\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003988\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007063\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007210\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011162\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011923\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"12808\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"12809\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"12810\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"e033d58e-8545-4f81-a191-03352ebe4cc0\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006609\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008158\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Entertainment Film Distributors\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006610\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Sentimental Value\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Nora Borg (Renate Reinsve) is an established Oslo stage actress; her younger sister Agnes (Inga Ibsdotter Lilleaas) has chosen family life with her young son. Though markedly different, the two are close and deeply intertwined, having been raised by a single mother after their filmmaker father’s departure years earlier. When the once renowned Gustav (Stellan Skarsgård) attempts to cast Nora in his comeback film, old wounds bleed anew; \\\"Nora rejects his offer, prompting the isolated patriarch to cast American star Rachel Kemp (Elle Fanning), who gradually comes to realize she has unwittingly become part of a deeply personal film drama. Agnes, meanwhile, delves deeper into the family history as Gustav and Nora attempt rapprochement; but the cracks at the base of the family home run deeper than any Borg can grasp, threatening to topple an already shaky foundation.\\r\\n\\r\\nThis special preview is presented in partnership with The Observer and will feature a post-film conversation between film critic Wendy Ide and leading actor Stellan Skarsgård.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Sisters Nora and Agnes reunite with their estranged father, the charismatic Gustav, a once renowned director who offers stage actress Nora a role.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong language, suicide references\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-12-26\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":133,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Gb1sSfWb1Og\",\"displayPriority\":2,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001057\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001058\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001695\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002275\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002626\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002629\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002630\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003236\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008105\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012671\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012672\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012673\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012674\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"938\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"5b779d8b-e80b-4790-9616-e4b978f19314\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006610\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008159\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"MUBI\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006487\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Frankenstein\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Oscar-winning director Guillermo del Toro adapts Mary Shelley’s classic tale of Victor Frankenstein, a brilliant but egotistical scientist who brings a creature to life in a monstrous experiment that ultimately leads to the undoing of both the creator and his tragic creation.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Oscar-winning director Guillermo del Toro adapts Mary Shelley’s classic tale of Victor Frankenstein, a brilliant but egotistical scientist who brings a creature to l